@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

participant "LoginView" as View
participant "AuthController" as Controller
participant "AuthService" as Service
participant "UserRepository" as Repo
database "Stored Users" as Storage
participant "SessionManager" as Session

== Input Data ==

View -> Controller: login(LoginInput)
note right of View
  **LoginInput**
  username
  password
end note

== Credential Check ==

Controller -> Service: authenticate(LoginInput)
Service -> Repo: findByUsername(username)
Repo -> Storage: read user record
Storage --> Repo: User or not found
Repo --> Service: User or null

alt user not found or password does not match
    Service --> Controller: AuthError("Invalid username or password")
    Controller --> View: Display error message
else credentials match

    == Create Session ==

    Service -> Session: createSession(User)
    Session --> Service: UserSession(userId, username)

    == Output Data ==

    Service --> Controller: LoginResult(UserSession)
    Controller --> View: Confirmation: user is now logged in
end

== Cancel Login ==

View -> Controller: cancelLogin()
Controller --> View: Request cancellation confirmation
View -> Controller: confirmCancellation()
Controller -> Service: discardLoginInput(LoginInput)
Service --> Controller: Input discarded (nothing saved)
Controller --> View: Use case ends

@enduml